  1605	    # laundered rejection artifact, not a review — reject it for BOTH sources
  1606	    # even when the hash matches. capture_run writes this line only on a nonzero
  1607	    # exit, so a genuine passing capture is never the placeholder; this closes
  1608	    # the forge where a FAILED capture's exit_code is hand-edited 1->0 (exit_code
